---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import siteData from "../../content/site.json";
---
<BaseLayout title="Events" description="Find Good Intentions at vintage markets and community pop-ups.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Shop the rack in person</span>
    <h1>Markets and pop-ups</h1>
    <p>Events are where Good Intentions makes the most sense: clothes on the rack, music in the room, and Sage there to help you find something.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section event-status-grid">
    <div class="next-event-panel">
      <span class="eyebrow">Next date</span>
      <strong>Being confirmed</strong>
      <p>Instagram is still the fastest place to catch the newest flyer, time, and location.</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href={siteData.business.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Check the latest event post</a>
    </div>
    <div class="event-route-panel">
      <span class="eyebrow">Where the rack has traveled</span>
      <h2>Albany · Troy · Saratoga · Burlington</h2>
      <p>Past posts have included vintage markets, neighborhood pop-ups, themed collections, and community events around New York and nearby.</p>
      <div class="event-type-strip">
        <span>vintage markets</span>
        <span>community pop-ups</span>
        <span>themed events</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section market-reasons-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Why shop in person</span>
        <h2>Some clothes need to be seen on a rack.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="market-reasons">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>See the real color and texture</h3><p>Secondhand pieces can look completely different once you can touch the fabric and see the details up close.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Ask Sage about the fit</h3><p>Talk through sizing, styling ideas, and what else could work with the piece before you take it home.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Catch pieces before they go online</h3><p>Events often include fresh finds and one-of-one items that may never make it to a website listing.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
